{"en": "1437466625", "title": "Surveillance environnementale : vue d'ensemble du processus", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cette vue d'ensemble regroupe, dans l'ordre, les liens vers l'ensemble du processus de surveillance environnementale. Commencez par les concepts, suivez les étapes de la saisie de la demande jusqu'au certificat de conformité, et consultez la configuration administrateur sur laquelle il repose."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Concepts"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les trois domaines et l'assistant de demande commun", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1428881409"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Évaluation de la conformité", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1428946945"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Processus (dans l'ordre)"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir une demande environnementale", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427898372"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étiqueter et stocker les échantillons (étape commune)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1428684802"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Effectuer la revue assurance qualité (étape commune)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1429176321"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisir les résultats et lire l'évaluation de la conformité", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427275807"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Valider et libérer les résultats", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427439642"}}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Générer un certificat de conformité (Laporan Hasil)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427505177"}}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configuration administrateur"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configurer les normes de conformité et les délais de conservation", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1427931149"}}]}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}